<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Zurich shares.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Zurich shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc, New York said</p>
<p>it has issued 80,000 European style capped low exercise price</p>
<p>option' warrants, on Zurich Insurance registered shares.</p>
<p>One warrant controls on share.</p>
<p> LONG CALL STRKE PRICE   0.01 CHF</p>
<p>SHORT CALL STRIKE PRICE 450 CHF ISSUE PRICE  415 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.APR.98		 PAYDATE	09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  468.75 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
